      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma Akab oto, jo Moab gucako jemo woko i kom Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nu Akajia opoto piny ki i waŋ dirica ki i kicikane mamalo ma i Camaria, odoko two ma obuto kwede piny; omiyo ocwalo lukwena, kun waco botgi ni, “Wucit wucipeny dog Baaljebub, lubaŋa pa jo Ekron, ni nyo abicaŋ ki two man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lamalaika pa Rwot owaco ki Elia ma Laticbe ni, “A malo, wek icit icirom ki lukwena pa kabaka me Camaria” ci iwac botgi ni, ‘Wutimo kuman ni Lubaŋa mo pe i Icrael, mumiyo wucito ka penyo dog Baal-jebub, ma lubaŋa pa jo Ekron-ni?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi kit tim man, Rwot owacci, ‘In pe ibia malo ki i wi kitanda ma ibuto iye-ni, ento ibito woko adada.’ ” Elia ocako cito woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lukwena gudok bot kabaka, ci openyogi ni, “Piŋo wudwogo cen?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gugamo ni, “Dano mo obino oromo kwedwa i yo, ci owacowa ni, ‘Wudok cen bot kabaka ma oorowu-ni, wuciwacce ni, Rwot owaco kuman ni, Itimo kuman ni Lubaŋa mo pe i Icrael, mumiyo icwalo ni gipeny dog Baaljebub, ma lubaŋa pa jo Ekron-ni? Pi kit tim man, omiyo in pe ibia malo ki i wi kitanda ma ibuto iye-ni, ento ibito woko adada.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En openyogi ni, “Dano ma orwatte kwedwu-ni obedo niŋniŋ ma olokowu lok magi-ni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gugamo ni, “En oruko ginaruka ma obedo yeryer, kun otweyo pyere ki del.” Ci ogamo ni, “Meno en Elia Laticbe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok ocwalo ladit me mony ma loyo jo pyerabic kacel, ki jone pyerabic. En ocito bot Elia, ma onoŋo obedo malo i wi got, ci owacce ni, “Ai dano pa Lubaŋa, kabaka owacci, ‘Ilor piny.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 9.54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Elia ogamo dog ladit me mony ma loyo jo pyerabic-ci ni, “Ka an aye a dano pa Lubaŋa, wek mac oa ki malo i polo owaŋ in woko kacel ki joni pyerabic-ci ducu.” Ci mac oa malo ki i polo owaŋo en ki jone pyerabic-ci ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok ocwalo ladit me mony ma loyo jo pyerabic kacel ki jone pyerabic. Ocito bot Elia owacce ni, “Ai dano pa Lubaŋa, man aye cik pa kabaka ni, ‘Ilor piny oyotoyot.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Elia odok iye ki gin ni, “Ka ce an a dano pa Lubaŋa, wek mac aa ki malo i polo opot i komwu owaŋwu woko ducu, in kacel ki joni pyerabicci.” Ci mac pa Lubaŋa oa ki malo i polo owaŋo en ki jone pyerabic-ci ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok ocwalo ladit me mony me adekke ma loyo dano pyerabic, kacel ki jone. Ci ladit me adekke ma loyo jo pyerabic ocito. Ka oo, ci opoto orumo coŋe piny i nyim Elia, obako doge bote ni, “Ai dano pa Lubaŋa, alegi ni, pe ineka kacel ki joni pyerabicci, piwa obed tek ki in, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien, nen, mac oa ki i polo ci obino piny, owaŋo ludito mony aryo mukwoŋo-ni ducu kacel ki jogi ma giloyo pyerabic-ci; ento in iwek, pi kwena obed tekki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamalaika pa Rwot owaco bot Elia ni, “Lworo pe omaki i kome, Lor piny icit kwede.” Omiyo en ocito owoto kacel kwede bot kabaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci owacce ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Pien icwalo lukwena ka penyo dog Baal-jebub, lubaŋa pa jo Ekron, itimo kumeno ni Lubaŋa pe i Icrael bo, mumiyo ipenyo doge-ni? En aye lok mumi yo pe ibia ki i wi kitandani ma it ye iye-ni, ento in ibito woko adada.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akajia oto woko kit macalo Rwot oloko ki i dog Elia-ni, Jekoram ma ominne aye odoko kabaka ma oleyo ka tyene, i mwaka me aryo me loc pa Tekoram wod pa Yekocapat, kabaka me Juda, pien onoŋo Akajia pe tye ki wode mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok kom Akajia mudoŋŋe ducu, ma en otiyo, gityeko coyone i buk me Tekwaro pa Luker me Icrael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
